  "definition": "Notification of Groundwater Quality Violation",
  "effectiveDate": "2024-12-25",
  "historyNote": "(See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-Or 600) #8812, eff 2-1-07; ss by #10831, eff 6-1-15; ss by #14159, eff 12-25-24",
